Description: Edits your homescreen layout on iOS 16-17, page by page.
 * set rows, columns, icon size & spacing.
 * move icon labels & page dots.
 * set the dock's rows, columns & background alpha.
 * add page labels & a welcome message.
 * blur & tint a background behind your icons.
 * put App Library & recents in the floating dock.
 * hide page dots, badges, labels & the dock.
 * export & import your settings.
 * support roothide.
